rk evidence and have interpersonal or health concerns.\n**Remaining uncertainty**: How severely C\u2019s communication difficulty would impact real\u2011time crew coordination and safety; whether his reluctance to further education would hinder adaptation to evolving avionics.\n**What would change my vote**: Concrete evidence that another candidate (especially A or D) possesses strong, demonstrable teamwork/communication abilities that outweigh their negatives, or any additional safety\u2011critical weakness for C (e.g., inability to follow procedures under fatigue).\nMETADATA_JSON:\n{\"agent\": \"agent_2\", \"vote\": \"Candidate C\"}"}
