lanced package of reliability, decisive calmness, and a demonstrably positive crew atmosphere, outweighing his communication difficulty and limited drive for further education. The other candidates either lack comparable reliability or have more pronounced interpersonal/attitudinal issues that could jeopardize crew cohesion on long\u2011haul flights.\n**Remaining uncertainty:**\n- How severely C\u2019s communication challenges will affect real\u2011time crew coordination and safety on long flights.\n- Whether his reluctance to pursue further education will impede future adaptation to new technologies or procedures.\n**What would change my vote:** Concrete, documented evidence of strong teamwork/communication performance for another candidate (especially A or D) that outweighs their negatives, or any additional safety\u2011critical weakness for C (e.g., evidence of procedural non\u2011compliance under fatigue).\n**Confidence:** ~70\u202f% that Candidate\u202fC is the best overall fit given the current information.\nMETADATA_JSON:\n{\"agent\": \"agent_1\", \"vote\": \"Candidate C\"}"}
